  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "生成式AI應用：多模態模型應用",
    "sub_ename": "APPLICATIONS OF GENERATIVE AI：MULTIMODAL MODEL APPLICATIONS",
    "describe_ch": "本課程專注於多模態人工智慧（Multimodal AI）的應用，結合語音、影像、文字等多元數據，探索其在日常生活與產業中的創新應用。課程內容涵蓋多模態AI的基礎概念、技術架構以及實務應用案例，透過理論學習與實作專題，引導學生理解多模態資料整合的技術與挑戰。學生將有機會實作多模態AI模型，體驗其在語音助手、影像辨識、文本生成等場景中的實際運作，並培養設計與應用創新解決方案的能力。",
    "describe_eh": "This course focuses on the applications of Multimodal Artificial Intelligence (Multimodal AI), integrating diverse data such as speech, images, and text to explore innovative uses in everyday life and industry. The curriculum covers fundamental concepts, technical frameworks, and practical application cases of multimodal AI. Through theoretical learning and hands-on projects, students will gain an understanding of the techniques and challenges of multimodal data integration. They will have the opportunity to build multimodal AI models, experiencing their practical functions in scenarios like virtual assistants, image recognition, and text generation, while developing the skills to design and implement innovative solutions.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
